    \item Clinical vs. MRI models: ΔAUROC = 0.108 (95\% CI 0.095-0.121; p < 0.001).
\end{itemize}

The ensemble maintained AUROC = 0.920 while reducing variance by 32\% relative to Gradient Boosting alone.

